      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file that consumes one message from a managed subscription or queue, I will use Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS) as the external provider. This choice is based on the requirement to use a concrete external provider and make it identifiable in the code. The boto3 library will be used to interact with SQS, which is the AWS SDK for Python. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
